The hero could still pacify his Quest leader in this scenario.  Right
now I've removed all the portal-sealings, and once the leader is angry
he'll quit kicking you out at all and instead move to just trying to
kill you.

Once he's peaceful again and you re-raise your alignment, you should be
able to Quest just fine the 'standard' way.

Killing your quest leader is for those who self-convert prior to the
Quest, not those who accidentally anger the leader and then need to
pacify him... in which case it is _quite_ consistent with the role-playing.

