Right.  Or, obviously, an opportunity to ascend after an on-purpose,
though that path should be significantly harder than just getting to
XL14, Questing as normal, and killing just the Nemesis.  Killing your
Leader will only open the stairs; you won't be arbitrarily handed the
Bell on the spot or or anything.

> But then again, I can see an argument that wielding
> Stormbringer in the vicinity of the Quest Leader is just as
> potentially game-ending as walking around with a wielded cockatrice
